  m_Name: Snow_ExpertAdvice_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Snow_ExpertAdvice_1
  headerName: "Expert Field Notes \u2014 Surviving an Avalanche"
  content: "An <color=#cc6600><b>avalanche</b></color> is a race against the clock
    \u2014 snow stops moving and freezes solid within minutes.\n\n<size=120%><b>1.
    When it Starts</b></size>\n\n* <color=#cc6600><b>Run sideways:</b></color> Never
    straight downhill.\n* <color=#cc6600><b>Grab something:</b></color> A tree, anything
    anchored \u2014 if you can.\n* <color=#cc6600><b>Whiteout:</b></color> If whiteout
    conditions develop: stop moving. Find cover. Wait for visibility to return. Walking
    blind in an avalanche zone means walking off a cliff.\n\n<size=120%><b>2. Warning
    Signs</b></size>\n\n* <color=#cc6600><b>A 'whump' sound:</b></color> as compressed
    air escapes beneath your feet \u2014 the snowpack below is unstable.\n* <color=#cc6600><b>Crack:</b></color>
    Visible cracks spreading outward from where you stand. The snow is already separating."
  type: 0
  biome: 2
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  dialogData: {fileID: 0}
